{
  "_comment": "Pins RFC-MACP-0010 Section 2.1 (authority matrix) and Section 5 rules 1-5 and 5.1(3), one constraint per rejected step. No implicit-accept policy is bound.",
  "description": "Handoff Mode: sender authority, handoff_id references, one outstanding offer at a time, and settled-offer rules.",
  "mode": "macp.mode.handoff.v1",
  "initiator": "agent://owner",
  "participants": [
    "agent://owner",
    "agent://target",
    "agent://target2"
  ],
  "mode_version": "1.0.0",
  "configuration_version": "cfg-1",
  "policy_version": "",
  "ttl_ms": 60000,
  "messages": [
    {
      "_comment": "Section 2.1: only the current responsibility owner (the initiator) may send HandoffOffer. No offer is outstanding and h1 is unused, so the sender is the only fault.",
      "sender": "agent://target",
      "message_type": "HandoffOffer",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.handoff.v1.HandoffOfferPayload",
      "payload": {
        "handoff_id": "h1",
        "target_participant": "agent://target2",
        "scope": "support",
        "reason": "escalate"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "FORBIDDEN"
    },
    {
      "sender": "agent://owner",
      "message_type": "HandoffOffer",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.handoff.v1.HandoffOfferPayload",
      "payload": {
        "handoff_id": "h1",
        "target_participant": "agent://target",
        "scope": "support",
        "reason": "escalate"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Section 5 rule 5: a new HandoffOffer MUST NOT be issued while a prior offer is still pending. h1 is unaccepted and undeclined; h2 is a new id to a target that has not declined.",
      "sender": "agent://owner",
      "message_type": "HandoffOffer",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.handoff.v1.HandoffOfferPayload",
      "payload": {
        "handoff_id": "h2",
        "target_participant": "agent://target2",
        "scope": "support",
        "reason": "escalate"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "INVALID_ENVELOPE"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Section 2.1: only the current responsibility owner may send HandoffContext.",
      "sender": "agent://target",
      "message_type": "HandoffContext",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.handoff.v1.HandoffContextPayload",
      "payload": {
        "handoff_id": "h1",
        "content_type": "text/plain",
        "context": "notes"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "FORBIDDEN"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Section 5 rule 2: HandoffContext MUST reference an existing handoff_id.",
      "sender": "agent://owner",
      "message_type": "HandoffContext",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.handoff.v1.HandoffContextPayload",
      "payload": {
        "handoff_id": "h9",
        "content_type": "text/plain",
        "context": "notes"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "INVALID_ENVELOPE"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Section 5 rule 2: HandoffDecline MUST reference an existing handoff_id.",
      "sender": "agent://target",
      "message_type": "HandoffDecline",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.handoff.v1.HandoffDeclinePayload",
      "payload": {
        "handoff_id": "h9",
        "declined_by": "agent://target",
        "reason": "at capacity"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "INVALID_ENVELOPE"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Section 5 rule 3 and Section 2.1: HandoffAccept MUST come from the offer's target_participant; agent://target2 is a declared participant but not h1's target.",
      "sender": "agent://target2",
      "message_type": "HandoffAccept",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.handoff.v1.HandoffAcceptPayload",
      "payload": {
        "handoff_id": "h1",
        "accepted_by": "agent://target2",
        "reason": "ready"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "FORBIDDEN"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Section 5 rule 3 and Section 2.1: HandoffDecline MUST come from the offer's target_participant.",
      "sender": "agent://target2",
      "message_type": "HandoffDecline",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.handoff.v1.HandoffDeclinePayload",
      "payload": {
        "handoff_id": "h1",
        "declined_by": "agent://target2",
        "reason": "at capacity"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "FORBIDDEN"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Section 5.1(3): a client-submitted HandoffAccept carrying implicit: true MUST be rejected. The sender is h1's target and h1 is pending, so implicit is the only fault.",
      "sender": "agent://target",
      "message_type": "HandoffAccept",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.handoff.v1.HandoffAcceptPayload",
      "payload": {
        "handoff_id": "h1",
        "accepted_by": "agent://target",
        "reason": "ready",
        "implicit": true
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "INVALID_ENVELOPE"
    },
    {
      "sender": "agent://target",
      "message_type": "HandoffDecline",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.handoff.v1.HandoffDeclinePayload",
      "payload": {
        "handoff_id": "h1",
        "declined_by": "agent://target",
        "reason": "at capacity"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Section 5 rules 1 and 3a: after a decline, a new HandoffOffer MUST carry a new handoff_id. h1 is reused; agent://target2 has not declined and no offer is pending, so the reused id is the only fault.",
      "sender": "agent://owner",
      "message_type": "HandoffOffer",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.handoff.v1.HandoffOfferPayload",
      "payload": {
        "handoff_id": "h1",
        "target_participant": "agent://target2",
        "scope": "support",
        "reason": "escalate"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "INVALID_ENVELOPE"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Section 2.1: Commitment authority is the current responsibility owner by default; agent://target is a participant but not the owner.",
      "sender": "agent://target",
      "message_type": "Commitment",
      "payload_type": "macp.v1.CommitmentPayload",
      "payload": {
        "commitment_id": "c1",
        "action": "handoff.declined",
        "authority_scope": "test",
        "reason": "done",
        "mode_version": "1.0.0",
        "policy_version": "policy.default",
        "configuration_version": "cfg-1",
        "outcome_positive": false
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "FORBIDDEN"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Section 5 rule 5: sequential offers to different targets are allowed once the prior offer is settled.",
      "sender": "agent://owner",
      "message_type": "HandoffOffer",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.handoff.v1.HandoffOfferPayload",
      "payload": {
        "handoff_id": "h2",
        "target_participant": "agent://target2",
        "scope": "support",
        "reason": "escalate"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "sender": "agent://target2",
      "message_type": "HandoffAccept",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.handoff.v1.HandoffAcceptPayload",
      "payload": {
        "handoff_id": "h2",
        "accepted_by": "agent://target2",
        "reason": "ready"
      },
      "expect": "accept"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Section 5 rule 4: once an offer has been accepted, no competing accept for that same handoff_id is valid.",
      "sender": "agent://target2",
      "message_type": "HandoffAccept",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.handoff.v1.HandoffAcceptPayload",
      "payload": {
        "handoff_id": "h2",
        "accepted_by": "agent://target2",
        "reason": "ready"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "INVALID_ENVELOPE"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Section 5 rule 4 and Section 5.1(4): a decline after the offer is accepted is invalid.",
      "sender": "agent://target2",
      "message_type": "HandoffDecline",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.handoff.v1.HandoffDeclinePayload",
      "payload": {
        "handoff_id": "h2",
        "declined_by": "agent://target2",
        "reason": "at capacity"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "INVALID_ENVELOPE"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Section 5 rule 5: once an offer is accepted, no further offers may be issued for the Session. h3 is new and agent://target2 has never declined, so acceptance of h2 is the only fault.",
      "sender": "agent://owner",
      "message_type": "HandoffOffer",
      "payload_type": "macp.modes.handoff.v1.HandoffOfferPayload",
      "payload": {
        "handoff_id": "h3",
        "target_participant": "agent://target2",
        "scope": "support",
        "reason": "escalate"
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "INVALID_ENVELOPE"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "Section 2.1: the new responsibility holder does not acquire Commitment authority; the default authority remains the session initiator.",
      "sender": "agent://target2",
      "message_type": "Commitment",
      "payload_type": "macp.v1.CommitmentPayload",
      "payload": {
        "commitment_id": "c1",
        "action": "handoff.accepted",
        "authority_scope": "test",
        "reason": "done",
        "mode_version": "1.0.0",
        "policy_version": "policy.default",
        "configuration_version": "cfg-1",
        "outcome_positive": true
      },
      "expect": "reject",
      "expected_error_code": "FORBIDDEN"
    }
  ],
  "expected_final_state": "Open",
  "expected_mode_state": {
    "offers": {
      "h1": {
        "disposition": "Declined"
      },
      "h2": {
        "disposition": "Accepted"
      }
    }
  },
  "expect_resolution_present": false
}
